{"name":"Slider","description":"Drag to adjust a value within a range · A slider is useful for quickly changing volume, brightness, or a price range. Show the limits and current value, and make the control work from the keyboard. If an exact number matters, pair it with an Number Input .","quote":"I want a draggable slider for setting the price range.","agentPrompt":"Build volume as a 0–100 slider with a continuously visible value, live audio updates while dragging, and arrow-key support. Test mouse, touch, and keyboard input, and do not wait until drag end to apply the value.","html":"<div class=\"detail-body detail-entry-slider\"><section class=\"detail-hero\" id=\"detail-hero\"><div class=\"dh-head\"><h1>Slider</h1></div><div class=\"dh-quote\"><span class=\"dh-quote-label\">You might say</span><p class=\"dh-quote-text\">I want a draggable slider for setting the price range.</p></div><div class=\"dh-tagline\"><strong class=\"dh-summary-lead\">Drag to adjust a value within a range</strong><span class=\"dh-summary-separator\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span>A slider is useful for quickly changing volume, brightness, or a price range. Show the limits and current value, and make the control work from the keyboard. If an exact number matters, pair it with an <a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/input-number?lang=en\" data-ref=\"input-number\" aria-label=\"Number Input\">Number Input</a>.</span></div><div class=\"dh-demo\"><div class=\"dh-demo-viewport\"><div class=\"dh-demo-inner\"><div class=\"sld-col\">\n        <span class=\"sld-line\">Volume<input type=\"range\" class=\"demo-range\" value=\"60\"></span>\n        <span class=\"sld-line\">Brightness<input type=\"range\" class=\"demo-range\" value=\"30\"></span>\n      </div></div></div></div></section><div class=\"lesson-extras\"><section class=\"lesson-agent-prompt\" aria-labelledby=\"lesson-agent-title\"><h2 id=\"lesson-agent-title\">You can say this to an AI Agent</h2><blockquote><span class=\"lesson-agent-quote\" aria-hidden=\"true\">“</span><p>Build volume as a 0–100 slider with a continuously visible value, live audio updates while dragging, and arrow-key support. Test mouse, touch, and keyboard input, and do not wait until drag end to apply the value.</p></blockquote></section></div><div class=\"usage-grid\"><div class=\"usage-box use\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12.5 4.2 4.2L19 7\"></path></svg></span>When to use it</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">Volume or brightness</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"color:var(--text-2)\">🔊</span><span class=\"mk-progress\" style=\"width:110px\"><i style=\"width:60%\"></i></span><span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">60</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">Price range</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">Pricing</span><span class=\"mk-progress\" style=\"width:110px\"><i style=\"width:50%;margin-left:25%\"></i></span></div><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"color:var(--text-2)\">¥100 — ¥300</span></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">Image adjustment</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"width:46px;color:var(--text-3)\">Creative intensity</span><span class=\"mk-progress\" style=\"width:110px\"><i style=\"width:70%\"></i></span><span style=\"color:var(--text-2)\">High</span></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">A value where relative position is useful</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"color:var(--text-2)\">☀</span><span class=\"mk-progress\" style=\"width:110px\"><i style=\"width:80%\"></i></span></div></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"usage-box dont\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7l10 10M17 7 7 17\"></path></svg></span>When NOT to use it</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">Ask for an exact value without displaying it</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span class=\"mk-progress\" style=\"width:110px\"><i style=\"width:63%\"></i></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">For exact values, pair it with a number input</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">Use a narrow track for a very large range</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span class=\"mk-progress\" style=\"width:110px\"><i style=\"width:33%\"></i></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">For a few discrete levels, list the options directly</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">Hide the minimum and maximum when they matter</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span class=\"mk-progress\" style=\"width:110px\"><i style=\"width:2%\"></i></span><span style=\"color:var(--text-2)\">2,431 / 100,000</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">With too wide a range, dragging can’t reliably reach the target value</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">Require dragging as the only accessible input method</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span class=\"mk-progress\" style=\"width:110px\"><i style=\"width:40%\"></i></span><span style=\"color:var(--text-2)\">July 12</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">Use a date picker for dates</span></div></div></li></ul></div></div><section><div class=\"section-title\">Anatomy</div><div class=\"anat-wrap\"><div class=\"anat-stage\"><span class=\"sld\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"track\"><i class=\"sld-trk\"></i></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"fill\"><i class=\"sld-fl\" style=\"width:60%\"></i></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"thumb\"><i class=\"sld-th\" style=\"left:calc(60% - 8px)\"></i></span></span>\n          <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"value\"><b class=\"sld-val\">60</b></span></div><div class=\"anat-parts\"><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"track\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">1</span><span class=\"pn\">Track</span></button><span class=\"pd\">The full selectable range</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"fill\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">2</span><span class=\"pn\">Fill</span></button><span class=\"pd\">Shows the selected portion of the range</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"thumb\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">3</span><span class=\"pn\">Handle</span></button><span class=\"pd\">Drag the thumb; enlarge it on hover</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"value\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">4</span><span class=\"pn\">Value</span></button><span class=\"pd\">Updates in real time while dragging</span></div></div></div></section><section><div class=\"section-title\">Variants</div><div class=\"variant-grid\"><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">Default</div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><input type=\"range\" class=\"demo-range\" value=\"40\"></div><div class=\"variant-when\">Continuous adjustment of volume, brightness, etc.</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">Range</div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><span class=\"sld-plain\"><i class=\"sld-trk\"></i><i class=\"sld-fl\" style=\"left:25%;width:45%\"></i><i class=\"sld-th\" style=\"left:25%\"></i><i class=\"sld-th\" style=\"left:70%\"></i></span></div><div class=\"variant-when\">When users need to select a range, such as a minimum and maximum price.</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">With Marks</div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><span class=\"sld-marks-wrap\"><input type=\"range\" class=\"demo-range\" value=\"50\"><span class=\"sld-marks\"><span>0</span><span>50</span><span>100</span></span></span></div><div class=\"variant-when\">Snap the slider to a few meaningful values.</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">Disabled</div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><input type=\"range\" class=\"demo-range\" value=\"70\" disabled></div><div class=\"variant-when\">This adjustment is currently unavailable</div></div></div></section><section class=\"scenes\"><div class=\"section-title\">Typical use cases</div><div class=\"scene-list\"><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">Media volume</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"max-width:360px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\">\n          <div class=\"slider-sc-row\"><span style=\"width:46px\">🔊 Volume</span><span class=\"sld-plain\" style=\"flex:1;width:auto\"><i class=\"sld-trk\"></i><i class=\"sld-fl\" style=\"left:0;width:60%\"></i><i class=\"sld-th\" style=\"left:60%\"></i></span><b style=\"width:24px;text-align:right\">60</b></div>\n          <div class=\"slider-sc-row\"><span style=\"width:46px\">☀️ Brightness</span><span class=\"sld-plain\" style=\"flex:1;width:auto\"><i class=\"sld-trk\"></i><i class=\"sld-fl\" style=\"left:0;width:80%\"></i><i class=\"sld-th\" style=\"left:80%\"></i></span><b style=\"width:24px;text-align:right\">80</b></div>\n          <div class=\"slider-sc-row\" style=\"border-bottom:0\"><span style=\"width:46px\">🎧 Bass</span><span class=\"sld-plain\" style=\"flex:1;width:auto\"><i class=\"sld-trk\"></i><i class=\"sld-fl\" style=\"left:0;width:35%\"></i><i class=\"sld-th\" style=\"left:35%\"></i></span><b style=\"width:24px;text-align:right\">35</b></div>\n        </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">Product filter</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"max-width:360px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\">\n          <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:10px\"><b style=\"font-size:13px\">Price range</b><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">¥100 — ¥300</span></div>\n          <span class=\"sld-plain\" style=\"width:100%\"><i class=\"sld-trk\"></i><i class=\"sld-fl\" style=\"left:20%;width:40%\"></i><i class=\"sld-th\" style=\"left:20%\"></i><i class=\"sld-th\" style=\"left:60%\"></i></span>\n          <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);margin-top:2px\"><span>¥0</span><span>¥500</span></div>\n          <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-top:10px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">86 products have been filtered</span><button class=\"btn btn-primary\">View results</button></div>\n        </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">Photo editor</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"max-width:420px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center\">\n          <div style=\"flex:1;background:var(--bg-soft);border:1px solid var(--border-light);border-radius:10px;height:116px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;overflow:hidden\">\n            <img src=\"/vibe-hub/source/assets/photo-cat.png\" style=\"width:80%;height:80%;object-fit:cover;border-radius:6px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\" alt=\"\">\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"width:150px;flex-shrink:0\">\n            <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);margin-bottom:6px\"><span>Scale</span><b>80%</b></div>\n            <span class=\"sld-plain\" style=\"width:100%\"><i class=\"sld-trk\"></i><i class=\"sld-fl\" style=\"left:0;width:80%\"></i><i class=\"sld-th\" style=\"left:80%\"></i></span>\n            <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);margin-top:2px\"><span>10%</span><span>200%</span></div>\n          </div>\n        </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">Preference setting</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"max-width:360px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:4px\">🤖 AI writing settings</div>\n          <div class=\"slider-sc-row\"><span style=\"width:52px\">Creative intensity</span><span class=\"sld-plain\" style=\"flex:1;width:auto\"><i class=\"sld-trk\"></i><i class=\"sld-fl\" style=\"left:0;width:70%\"></i><i class=\"sld-th\" style=\"left:70%\"></i></span><span class=\"demo-tag blue\">Stronger</span></div>\n          <div class=\"slider-sc-row\" style=\"border-bottom:0\"><span style=\"width:52px\">Reply length</span><span class=\"sld-plain\" style=\"flex:1;width:auto\"><i class=\"sld-trk\"></i><i class=\"sld-fl\" style=\"left:0;width:40%\"></i><i class=\"sld-th\" style=\"left:40%\"></i></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">Moderate</span></div>\n        </div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"selector-recommendation\" aria-label=\"Recommended tool\"><div class=\"section-title\">Recommended tool</div><a class=\"selector-recommendation-card\" href=\"https://selector-pro.org/\" target=\"_blank\" aria-label=\"Open the Selector Pro website to pick a page element and copy a fine-tuning request to AI\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><div class=\"selector-recommendation-copy\"><span class=\"selector-recommendation-label\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>Web fine-tuning tool · Selector Pro</span><h2>Select page elements for precise AI edits</h2><p>Click a button, text, or card, note the change, then copy its exact location to AI.</p><span class=\"selector-recommendation-action\">Open Selector Pro website<i aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</i></span></div><div class=\"selector-recommendation-demo\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"selector-mini-browser-bar\"><i></i><span>your-site.com</span></div><div class=\"selector-mini-page\"><span class=\"selector-mini-logo\"></span><span class=\"selector-mini-nav\"></span><span class=\"selector-mini-title\"></span><span class=\"selector-mini-line\"></span><span class=\"selector-mini-button\"></span><span class=\"selector-mini-card\"></span><span class=\"selector-mini-target\"><b>Button · Get started</b><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class=\"selector-mini-note\">Use a smaller radius</span><svg class=\"selector-mini-cursor\" viewbox=\"0 0 20 22\"><path d=\"M2 1.5v15.2l4.15-3.72 2.4 6.02 2.65-1.1-2.42-5.82h5.82L2 1.5Z\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"selector-mini-output\"><span>Button · Get started</span><b>Copied for AI</b></div></div></a></section><section class=\"references-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Further reading</div><div class=\"reference-list\"><a class=\"reference-link\" href=\"https://www.w3.org/WAI/ARIA/apg/patterns/slider/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"reference-title\">Slider Pattern</span><span class=\"reference-source\">WAI-ARIA APG ↗</span></a></div></section></div>","sourceUrl":"https://vibe-hub.org/en/slider","markdown":"# Slider\n\nYou might say\nI want a draggable slider for setting the price range.\n\n**Drag to adjust a value within a range**·A slider is useful for quickly changing volume, brightness, or a price range. Show the limits and current value, and make the control work from the keyboard. If an exact number matters, pair it with an [Number Input](/vibe-hub/input-number?lang=en).\n\n## You can say this to an AI Agent\n\n> “\n> Build volume as a 0–100 slider with a continuously visible value, live audio updates while dragging, and arrow-key support. Test mouse, touch, and keyboard input, and do not wait until drag end to apply the value.\n\n### When to use it\n\n- Volume or brightness\n\n🔊60\n- Price range\n\nPricing\n\n¥100 — ¥300\n- Image adjustment\n\nCreative intensityHigh\n- A value where relative position is useful\n\n☀\n\n### When NOT to use it\n\n- Ask for an exact value without displaying it\n\nFor exact values, pair it with a number input\n- Use a narrow track for a very large range\n\nFor a few discrete levels, list the options directly\n- Hide the minimum and maximum when they matter\n\n2,431 / 100,000\nWith too wide a range, dragging can’t reliably reach the target value\n- Require dragging as the only accessible input method\n\nJuly 12\nUse a date picker for dates\n\nAnatomy\n\n**60**\n\n1TrackThe full selectable range\n\n2FillShows the selected portion of the range\n\n3HandleDrag the thumb; enlarge it on hover\n\n4ValueUpdates in real time while dragging\n\nVariants\n\nDefault\n\nContinuous adjustment of volume, brightness, etc.\n\nRange\n\nWhen users need to select a range, such as a minimum and maximum price.\n\nWith Marks\n\n050100\n\nSnap the slider to a few meaningful values.\n\nDisabled\n\nThis adjustment is currently unavailable\n\nTypical use cases\n\nMedia volume\n\n🔊 Volume**60**\n\n          \n☀️ Brightness**80**\n\n          \n🎧 Bass**35**\n\nProduct filter\n\n**Price range**¥100 — ¥300\n\n          \n          \n¥0¥500\n\n          \n86 products have been filteredView results\n\nPhoto editor\n\nScale**80%**\n\n            \n            \n10%200%\n\nPreference setting\n\n🤖 AI writing settings\n\n          \nCreative intensityStronger\n\n          \nReply lengthModerate\n\nRecommended tool\n[Web fine-tuning tool · Selector Pro\n\n## Select page elements for precise AI edits\n\nClick a button, text, or card, note the change, then copy its exact location to AI.\nOpen Selector Pro website↗\n\nyour-site.com\n\n**Button · Get started**Use a smaller radius\n\nButton · Get started**Copied for AI**](https://selector-pro.org/)\n\nFurther reading\n\n[Slider PatternWAI-ARIA APG ↗](https://www.w3.org/WAI/ARIA/apg/patterns/slider/)"}